== Notes ==
* The area of effect is large; the spell description incorrectly lists it as colossal.
* The in-game description of this spell erroneously reports that it is affected by spell resistance; ''dispel magic'' does not check spell resistance.
* If used as an area of effect, this spell will also attempt to dispel any area of effect spells centered in affected area.
* Most of the spells of a [[class level|level]] 20 caster are immune to ''dispel magic'', as the dispeller's best possible roll is 30 (20+10), while the DC is 31 (11+20). The exceptions involve vagaries in determining the effective caster level; see [[dispel]] for details.

=== Previous versions ===

* Prior to NWN EE 1.74, an effect's caster's level had been added to 12, not 11, to get the dispel DC, even though the in-game text has always claimed "11". This meant that the spells of a caster with a level as low as 19 were immune to this spell.

